          %title D-brane charge quantization in topological K-theory
          %h3#DBraneChargeQuantizationInTopologicalKTheory D-brane charge quantization in topological K-theory
          %p
            On the conjectural
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-brane+charge+quantization+in+topological+K-theory"} D-brane charge quantization in topological K-theory
          %h4#origin_and_basics Origin and basics
          %p
            The idea that
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-branes"} D-branes
            have
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dirac+charge+quantization"} Dirac charge quantization
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+K-theory"} topological K-theory
            originates with the observation that their charge expressed in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/RR-field"} RR-field
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/flux+densities"} flux densities
            resembles the image of a
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chern+character"} Chern character
          %ul
            %li#GreenHarveyMoore97
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Green"}> Michael Green
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jeffrey+A.+Harvey"} Jeffrey A. Harvey
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gregory+Moore"} Gregory Moore
                = succeed "," do
                  %em I-Brane Inflow and Anomalous Couplings on D-Branes
                %strong 14
                (1997) 47-52 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1088/0264-9381/14/1/008"}> doi:10.1088/0264-9381/14/1/008
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9605033"} arXiv:hep-th/9605033
            %li#MinasianMoore97
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ruben+Minasian"}> Ruben Minasian
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gregory+Moore"} Gregory Moore
                = succeed "," do
                  %em K-theory and Ramond-Ramond charge
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1088/1126-6708/1997/11/002"} doi:10.1088/1126-6708/1997/11/002
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9710230"} arXiv:hep-th/9710230
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gregory+Moore"}> Gregory Moore
                ,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"} Edward Witten
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Self-Duality, Ramond-Ramond Fields, and K-Theory
                %strong 2000
                05 (2000) [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1088/1126-6708/2000/05/032"}> doi:10.1088/1126-6708/2000/05/032
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9912279"} arXiv:hep-th/9912279
          %p Further early discussion:
          %ul
            %li#Witten98
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"}> Edward Witten
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em D-Branes And K-Theory
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9810188"} arXiv:hep-th/9810188
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1088/1126-6708/1998/12/019"} doi:10.1088/1126-6708/1998/12/019
            %li#Horava98
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Petr+Ho%C5%99ava"}> Petr Hořava
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Type IIA D-Branes, K-Theory, and Matrix Theory
                %strong 2
                (1998) 1373-1404 [
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9812135"}> hep-th/9812135
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://intlpress.com/site/pub/files/_fulltext/journals/atmp/1998/0002/0006/ATMP-1998-0002-0006-a005.pdf"} atmp:1998-0002-0006-a005
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (essentially a hint at
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "Fredholm+operator#CanonicalRepresentativeOfpi3OfSAFred"} this construction
            %li#FreedHopkins00
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Daniel+Freed"}> Daniel Freed
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Hopkins"} Michael Hopkins
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On Ramond-Ramond fields and K-theory
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1088/1126-6708/2000/05/044"} doi:10.1088/1126-6708/2000/05/044
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0002027"} arXiv:hep-th/0002027
          %p
            and with emphasis on the full picture of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+differential+K-theory"} twisted
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+K-theory"} differential K-theory
            in:
          %ul
            %li#Freed00
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Daniel+Freed"}> Daniel Freed
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dirac+charge+quantization+and+generalized+differential+cohomology"} Dirac charge quantization and generalized differential cohomology
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0011220"} arXiv:hep-th/0011220
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://dx.doi.org/10.4310/SDG.2002.v7.n1.a6"} doi:10.4310/SDG.2002.v7.n1.a6
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://inspirehep.net/literature/537392"} spire:537392
          %p#BasisOfTheConjecture Here:
          %ul
            %li
              %a{:href => "#GreenHarveyMoore97"}> Green, Harvey &amp; Moore (1997)
              ,
              %a{:href => "#MinasianMoore97"} Minasian &amp; Moore (1997)
              observe that
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/RR-field"} RR-field
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/flux"} flux
              = succeed "-expressions" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+form"} form
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-brane+charge"} D-brane charge
              look like images of K-theory classes under the
              = succeed ";" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chern+character"} Chern character
          .float_right_image{:style => "margin: -40px 0px 20px 10px"}
            %figure{:style => "margin: 0 0 0 0"}
              %img{:src => "/nlab/files/AntiBraneAnnihilationAsKGroupEquivRelation.jpg", :width => "300px"}/
              %figcaption{:style => "text-align: center"}
                From
                %a{:href => "https://ncatlab.org/schreiber/show/Equivariant+Stable+Cohomotopy+and+Branes"} Sch 18
          %ul
            %li
              %a{:href => "#Witten98"} Witten 98, Section 3
              adds the observation that the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tachyon+condensation"} tachyon condensation
              – which is expected (this is
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sen%27s+conjecture"} Sen's conjecture
              from
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "Sen's+conjecture#ReferencesForSuperstrings"} Sen 98
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/open+strings"} open strings
              between
              = succeed "/" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-brane"} D-brane
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/anti-D-branes"} anti-D-branes
              – plausibly implements on their
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chan-Paton+gauge+field"} Chan-Paton
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vector+bundles"} vector bundles
              the defining
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivalence+relation"} equivalence relation
              (
              %a{:href => "topological+K-theory#eq:DefiningEquivalenceRelation"}> here
              ) of
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+K-theory"} topological K-theory
          %p
            Explicitly identifying the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tachyon"} tachyon
            field in this argument with the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fredholm+operator"} Fredholm operator
            in the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Atiyah-J%C3%A4nich+theorem"} Atiyah-Jänich presentation
            of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+K-theory"} topological K-theory
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "#Szabo2002"} Szabo 2002 §3.1
                (rewording
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "#Witten00"} Witten 2000 p 7
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dongfeng+Gao"}> Dongfeng Gao
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kentaro+Hori"} Kentaro Hori
                %em On The Structure Of The Chan-Paton Factors For D-Branes In Type II Orientifolds
                [
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1004.3972"}> arXiv:1004.3972
                ]
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (with application to
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orientifolds"} orientifolds
                  via
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KR-theory"} KR-theory
          %p
            The suggestion that the signs of the
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/eigenvalues"} eigenvalues
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spectrum+of+an+operator"} spectrum
            of self-adjoint Fredholm operators (
